    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stepping out of the gears... i dont know. everything i do just feels like it’s feeding the machine even more. i spend all day just trying to keep my head above water, but the water is rising. it's like even when I sleep, I can still feel the city breathing down my neck. i just want everything to be quiet. for real quiet.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
